    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Effective November 1, 1977\nSIXIRE\nFLIGHT TIMES\nFeaturing connecting or commuting\nservice to 11 California cities.\n7 San Francisco\n• San Jose\n7 Los Angeles\n• San Luis Obispo\nSanta Maria\n• Paso Robles\nSacramento\nFresno\n/ Bakersfield\nVisalia • Modesto\nNOW FLYING ... 29-PASSENGER NORD\n262 PROP-JETS ON SELECTED ROUTES",
      "REDDING\nSACRAMENTO\nMODESTO\nSAN FRANCISCO\nSWIRE\nSystem\nMap\nSAN JOSE\nFRESNO\nPASO\nROBLES\nVISALIA\nSAN LUIS OBISPO\nBAKERSFIELD\nSANTA MARIA\nLOS ANGELES\nSANTA BARBARA\nROUTES PENDING\nJOINT FARES PLAN\nYou can fly Swift Aire free, or at greatly reduced fares,\nwhen you connect on other airlines for flights to many\nlocations in the U.S.\nSWIFT AIRE AND AVIS\nRent a fine Avis car at destinations served by Swift Aire.\nSwift Aire and Avis, getting together to serve you better.\nFor Reservations and Flight Information\nIn California, Call Toll Free\n800 592-5900\n(Outside California, Dial (805) 544-4677.)\nIn San Luis Obispo--\n544-4677\nIn Santa Maria-_\n-925-0987\nIn Paso Robles...___.\n-238-5700\nOr see your travel agent."
    ],
